DaylightUI Addon Skins is free to download and play with. You may not copy, modify,
redistribute, re-upload or reuse any part of it (code, art or layouts),
in whole or in part, without written permission from the author.

DaylightUI Addon Skins is a plugin for DaylightUI: it needs DaylightUI installed to run,
and it holds no copies of DaylightUI's code or art. DaylightUI belongs to
its author and keeps its own licence.

The addons it dresses belong to their own authors. It holds none of their
code or art: it changes how their windows look while the game runs, and
leaves their files as they are.

Addons of your own are welcome, no permission needed: you may make, share
and upload your own addon that runs alongside DaylightUI Addon Skins and uses what it
offers in game. Your addon is your own work under your own licence. It
must not include copies of DaylightUI Addon Skins's code or art, and needs DaylightUI Addon Skins
installed to run.

